@startuml
title Attraction Operational - 3.6/3.9 (AttractionOperationalStatus)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EEECFB
  BorderColor #8B7FD6
  FontColor #1A1A1A
  ArrowColor #444444
}
hide empty description

[*] --> ACTIVE : Attraction created (default)
ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED : Admin hides (violation)\n[publishedAt set & operationalStatus=ACTIVE]\n(PUT /api/admin/attractions/:id/hide)
SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE : Admin restores\n(PUT /api/admin/attractions/:id/restore)

ACTIVE : Normal operation\n(status & publication unaffected)
SUSPENDED : Admin sanction\n(also forces publicationStatus = PAUSED,\nsets suspensionReason + suspendedAt)

note bottom
  Orthogonal to AttractionStatus and
  AttractionPublicationStatus. Suspending or
  restoring never changes status; both actions
  set publicationStatus = PAUSED.
end note
@enduml
